  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.DaprOASIS v2.0.3\n\nDapr Distributed Application Runtime Provider. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 4 new providers + orchestrators — 206 total (NATS, Temporal, Dapr, OpenVINO) (539966a)\n- feat: fully implement NATSJetStream, Temporal, Dapr, IntelOpenVINO providers (96c5459)\n- feat: implement real API/SDK for all new providers (21 providers across 6 categories) (0d09c71)\n- feat(DaprOASIS): full storage contract on any Dapr state store via the Dapr SDK (fed6708)\n- fix: resolve all build errors for new providers (stubs, usings, enum values) (a33a25e)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Other/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.DaprOASIS",
